{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["Before YHWH — 'in the name of YHWH.' But ״נמרוד גבור ציד לפני ה׳״ — its meaning is 'in all the world.' And likewise: ״נינוה היתה עיר גדולה לאלהים״ — in all the world of the Holy One, blessed be He, there was no city as great as Nineveh."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:45:22.739052431Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}